## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1-Codex-Mini
- **Short description:** OpenAI's smaller, cheaper GPT-5.1-Codex — the economy rung of the Codex line for agentic coding. **Shut down** per OpenAI's model documentation; retained for historical comparison.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI Responses API only; snapshot `gpt-5.1-codex-mini` — Status: Shut down.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released ~2025 (GPT-5.1 generation); reliable knowledge cutoff Sep 30, 2024.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.1-codex-mini`
- **Context window:** 400,000 tokens; max output 128,000 tokens.
- **Modalities:** text + image in; text out; reasoning token support; function calling, web search; Responses API only.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.25 / 1M input, $2.00 / 1M output, cached input $0.025; no Batch. (Model shut down — pricing retained for record.)
- **Architecture:** proprietary; parameter count undisclosed.

